{"inkVersion":20,"root":[["ev","str","^Jesse","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Well, I say a bartender as good as you don’t come around all that often. This here drink is amazing!","\n","ev","str","^Rana","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Haha, thanks!","\n","ev","str","^Jesse","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^An-...","\n","ev","str","^Rana","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Uh. You good?","\n","ev","str","^Jesse","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^I’m sorry, what am I even doing.","\n","ev","str","^Rana","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^What happened to your accent?","\n","ev","str","^Jesse","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Why am I even walking around with a cadaverifier threatening my friend?","\n","ev","str","^Rana","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Uh. I’m confused.","\n","ev","str","^Jesse","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Maybe, by trying to cling onto something that’s gone, we’re hurting what we still got?","\n","ev","str","^Rana","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Listen man, I just work here.","\n","ev","str","^Jesse","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^I’m done trying to play this part. It’s time to move on!","\n","ev","str","^Rana","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^…","\n","ev","str","^Rana","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^But.","\n","ev","str","^Jesse","/str",{"x()":"Name","exArgs":1},"out","/ev","\n","^Thank you for bestowing your wisdom upon me, wise gnome! I now take my leave.","\n",["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}